00:11:40.060 --> 00:11:40.800
Cela donne à chaque charge

00:11:40.800 --> 00:11:41.400
de travail une limite.

00:11:41.740 --> 00:11:42.360
L'assistant marketing

00:11:42.360 --> 00:11:43.000
peut avoir un budget

00:11:43.000 --> 00:11:44.200
adapté à son objectif.

00:11:44.740 --> 00:11:45.320
Le support client

00:11:45.320 --> 00:11:46.300
peut avoir sa propre allocation

00:11:46.300 --> 00:11:47.400
et une priorité plus élevée.

00:11:48.220 --> 00:11:49.200
Lorsque l'assistant marketing

00:11:49.200 --> 00:11:49.820
atteint sa limite,

00:11:50.080 --> 00:11:50.880
la passerelle peut rejeter

00:11:50.880 --> 00:11:51.360
ou ralentir

00:11:51.360 --> 00:11:52.040
ses prochaines requêtes.

00:11:52.680 --> 00:11:53.220
Le support client

00:11:53.220 --> 00:11:53.960
continue de fonctionner

00:11:53.960 --> 00:11:54.780
car un projet de test

00:11:54.780 --> 00:11:55.680
